[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025840\">7045A10</a> (left and right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025869\">7045B18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025834\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p>1. Take out the ashtray.</p><p>2. Withdraw the cigarette lighter seating (2a) using the special\ntool (2b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The tool must engage in the recesses\n(2c) in the cigarette lighter seating.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Pliers</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.028.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Cigar lighter/current socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024647\">P50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005498.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cigarette lighter\nseating is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Insert the cigarette lighter seat.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025834\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025869\">7045B18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025840\">7045A10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p>Check that the cigarette lighter is working.</p>"]]